# k6 load-test campaign output: run results and tenant files generated by
# backend/scripts/provision_load_test_tenants.py (synthetic credentials
# tied to a throwaway local/staging DB — never committed). The curated
# fixtures under load-tests/ (tenants.sample.json, tenants.10.json,
# tenants.50.json) are explicitly un-ignored below.
load-tests/results/
load-tests/tenants.*.json
!load-tests/tenants.sample.json
!load-tests/tenants.10.json
!load-tests/tenants.50.json
